{'symbol': 'CDAY', 'date': '2021-09-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'GOVERNMENT OF CANADA SELECTS CERIDIAN TO DELIVER THE NEXT GENERATION HR AND PAY PILOT', 'text': 'TORONTO, SEPT. 21, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CERIDIAN (NYSE: CDAY; TSX: CDAY), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM) TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN SELECTED TO DELIVER THE DESIGN AND EXPERIMENTATION PHASE OF THE NEXT GENERATION HUMAN RESOURCES AND PAY PILOT BY THE GOVERNMENT OF CANADA. CERIDIAN WILL WORK WITH THE GOVERNMENT OF CANADA TO CO-DESIGN AND DELIVER INTELLIGENT HR AND PAY SOLUTIONS FOR THE FEDERAL PUBLIC SERVICE.'}